WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.491 --> 00:00:04.542
IN OTHER WORDS, THEIR SAFETY HAS

00:00:04.543 --> 00:00:05.707
BEEN FULLY REIMAGINED.

00:00:05.742 --> 00:00:07.917
MARK MCCLOSKEY JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:07.951 --> 00:00:10.241
MARK, THANKS MUCH FOR COMING ON.

00:00:10.242 --> 00:00:12.018
SO BEFORE I ASK YOU ABOUT HOW

00:00:12.019 --> 00:00:14.180
YOU FEEL ABOUT THIS TO REIMAGINE

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:15.604
PUBLIC SAFETY YOU BEEN SUBJECTED

00:00:15.605 --> 00:00:17.591
TO, TELL US SPECIFICALLY WHAT

00:00:17.592 --> 00:00:18.990
HAPPEN WHEN THE POLICE VISITED

00:00:19.024 --> 00:00:20.289
YOUR HOME RECENTLY.

00:00:20.323 --> 00:00:22.489
&gt;&gt; WELL, YOU KNOW, THE POLICE

00:00:22.524 --> 00:00:23.435
WERE REALLY VERY PROFESSIONAL

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:24.354
AND VERY NICE.

00:00:24.388 --> 00:00:26.520
THEY COPS THAT CAME OUT TO ISSUE

00:00:26.554 --> 00:00:27.940
THE SEARCH WARRANT EN MASSE,

00:00:27.941 --> 00:00:28.787
THEY WERE ALMOST APOLOGETIC.

00:00:28.789 --> 00:00:30.132
THEY DIDN’T WANT TO HAVE TO BE

00:00:30.166 --> 00:00:30.884
THERE.

00:00:30.919 --> 00:00:32.802
THEY WERE DOING THEIR JOB.

00:00:32.804 --> 00:00:34.634
PATTY WANTED TO TAKE A PICTURE

00:00:34.635 --> 00:00:35.962
TO DOCUMENT IT AND SHE ASKED IF

00:00:35.963 --> 00:00:37.247
THEY WOULDN’T MIND FACING AWAY

00:00:37.281 --> 00:00:38.575
FROM THE CAMERA SO THAT PEOPLE

00:00:38.576 --> 00:00:39.974
WOULDN’T GET MAD AT THEM IF

00:00:40.009 --> 00:00:42.726
THEIR FACES WERE SHOWN ON TV.

00:00:42.761 --> 00:00:44.494
THEY ALL DID SO.

00:00:44.529 --> 00:00:45.626
THEY UNFORTUNATE ARE STUCK

00:00:45.627 --> 00:00:46.815
BETWEEN A CIRCUIT ATTORNEY THAT

00:00:46.849 --> 00:00:48.674
WANTS TO PROSECUTE US IN THEIR

00:00:48.676 --> 00:00:49.964
OWN BELIEF THAT WE DID

00:00:49.965 --> 00:00:51.084
ABSOLUTELY NOTHING WRONG.

00:00:51.119 --> 00:00:52.357
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT GOES WITHOUT

00:00:52.358 --> 00:00:53.348
SAYING, I MEAN, POLICE

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:54.752
DEPARTMENT’S ARE STRUCTURED

00:00:54.753 --> 00:00:57.073
ALONG THE LINES OF THE MILITARY.

00:00:57.107 --> 00:00:58.033
THEY DON’T MAKE INDEPENDENT.

00:00:58.067 --> 00:01:00.054
THEY ARE TOLD WHAT TO TO DO AND

00:01:00.055 --> 00:01:00.643
THEY DO IT.

00:01:00.677 --> 00:01:02.457
THEY DIDN’T MAKE THIS DECISION

00:01:02.458 --> 00:01:03.929
INDEPENDENTLY BUT YOU STILL CAN

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.139
ESCAPE THE CONTRAST OF WHAT

00:01:05.141 --> 00:01:07.221
HAPPENED THE NIGHT THE MOB CAME

00:01:07.256 --> 00:01:08.641
TO YOUR HOME AND YOU CALL THE

00:01:08.643 --> 00:01:10.176
POLICE AND THEY DIDN’T, AND THEN

00:01:10.177 --> 00:01:11.806
THEY COME AT THE COMMAND OF THE

00:01:11.808 --> 00:01:13.841
PROSECUTING ATTORNEY LATER TO

00:01:13.876 --> 00:01:15.958
TAKE THE DEFEND YOURSELF.

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:17.901
IS THAT WHAT POLICE ARE FOR, DO

00:01:17.935 --> 00:01:19.266
YOU THINK?

00:01:19.301 --> 00:01:21.500
&gt;&gt; WELL, YOU KNOW, AND MY

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:23.232
ATTORNEY ADVISED ME NOT TO BE ON

00:01:23.233 --> 00:01:24.744
THE SHOW TONIGHT BECAUSE THE

00:01:24.745 --> 00:01:26.293
RUMOR IS THAT WE ARE GOING TO BE

00:01:26.294 --> 00:01:27.251
INDICTED SHORTLY.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:29.956
HAVING SAID THAT, THIS IS THE

00:01:29.957 --> 00:01:31.329
SAME CIRCUIT ATTORNEY THAT

00:01:31.331 --> 00:01:32.904
REALLY 35 OF THE PROTESTERS THAT

00:01:32.905 --> 00:01:34.121
TORCHED AND LOOTED IN DOWNTOWN

00:01:34.155 --> 00:01:35.646
ST. LOUIS BUT NOW SHE WANTS TO

00:01:35.679 --> 00:01:36.388
INDICT ME.

00:01:36.389 --> 00:01:37.913
I DIDN’T SHOOT ANYBODY.

00:01:37.914 --> 00:01:39.772
I JUST HELD MY GROUND,

00:01:39.773 --> 00:01:41.055
PROTECTING MY HOUSE, AND I’M

00:01:41.057 --> 00:01:43.165
SITTING HERE ON TELEVISION

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.385
TONIGHT INSTEAD OF DEAD OR

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:46.545
PUTTING OUT THE SMOLDERING

00:01:46.546 --> 00:01:47.939
EMBERS OF MY HOME.

00:01:47.973 --> 00:01:49.943
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO I MEAN, YOUR

00:01:49.977 --> 00:01:53.156
STRATEGY IN RESPONSE TO ALL THIS

00:01:53.158 --> 00:01:55.476
SEEMS TO BE STAYING SILENT

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.143
DOESN’T GET TO ANYTHING,

00:01:57.177 --> 00:01:57.562
OBVIOUSLY.

00:01:57.596 --> 00:01:59.156
IF YOU JUST RETREATED INTO YOUR

00:01:59.157 --> 00:02:00.572
HOUSE, IT PROBABLY WOULD BE

00:02:00.574 --> 00:02:02.645
BURNED TO THE GROUND, AS YOU

00:02:02.679 --> 00:02:03.737
JUST SAID.

00:02:03.739 --> 00:02:06.310
BUT IS THAT HOW SOCIETY SHOULD

00:02:06.345 --> 00:02:06.715
FUNCTION?

00:02:06.716 --> 00:02:07.969
I MEAN, SHOULDN’T SOMEONE IN

00:02:08.003 --> 00:02:09.958
AUTHORITY IN THE STATE OF

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.691
MISSOURI BE COMING TO YOUR AID

00:02:11.725 --> 00:02:12.810
RIGHT ABOUT NOW?

00:02:12.844 --> 00:02:15.421
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, THE WAY I VIEW IT

00:02:15.455 --> 00:02:17.410
IS, WHEN YOU HAVE CERTAIN

00:02:17.444 --> 00:02:18.713
ELEMENTS OF SOCIETY ENCOURAGING

00:02:18.714 --> 00:02:20.544
VIOLENCE, AT THE SAME TIME

00:02:20.545 --> 00:02:22.780
ASKING THE POLICE TO STAND DOWN,

00:02:22.781 --> 00:02:24.357
WHAT’S THE ONLY POSSIBLE RESULT?

00:02:24.358 --> 00:02:25.662
THE ONLY POSSIBLE SOLUTION IS

00:02:25.663 --> 00:02:26.642
FOR INDIVIDUAL CITIZENS TO STAND

00:02:26.676 --> 00:02:29.069
UP AND DEFEND THEMSELVES.

00:02:29.103 --> 00:02:31.325
I’M AFRAID THAT WHAT’S BEING

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:32.544
PROMOTED IS CAUSING CITIZENS TO

00:02:32.546 --> 00:02:35.145
STAND UP AND DEFEND THEMSELVES

00:02:35.179 --> 00:02:38.807
SO THEY CAN BE ABUSED THE WAY WE

00:02:38.808 --> 00:02:39.542
HAVE BEEN.

00:02:39.543 --> 00:02:40.956
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I DON’T THINK

00:02:40.957 --> 00:02:42.028
THERE’S ANY DOUBT ABOUT THAT.

00:02:42.029 --> 00:02:44.187
I DON’T THINK THERE’S A

00:02:44.188 --> 00:02:45.999
HOMEOWNER IN AMERICA WANTS TO

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.705
DEFEND HIS OWN HOME WITH A GUN.

00:02:47.706 --> 00:02:49.011
THAT SOMETHING YOU DO IF YOU

00:02:49.012 --> 00:02:49.683
HAVE NO CHOICE.

00:02:49.718 --> 00:02:50.873
YOU’D MUCH RATHER THE POLICE

00:02:50.907 --> 00:02:52.863
CAME AND TOOK THE RISK FOR YOU.

00:02:52.864 --> 00:02:54.056
THAT’S WHY YOU PAY THEM BUT THEY

00:02:54.058 --> 00:02:54.565
WANT.

00:02:54.566 --> 00:02:56.535
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF THE MEDIA

00:02:56.569 --> 00:02:57.033
RESPONSE?

00:02:57.034 --> 00:02:58.665
YOU ARE LECTURED ON ANOTHER

00:02:58.666 --> 00:03:01.140
CHANNEL BY A GUY WHO’S

00:03:01.141 --> 00:03:02.312
THREATENED VIOLENCE AGAINST

00:03:02.314 --> 00:03:04.317
PEOPLE FOR GETTING IN HIS SPACE

00:03:04.318 --> 00:03:06.380
AND YET HE DRESSED YOU DOWN FOR

00:03:06.414 --> 00:03:07.084
DEFENDING YOUR HOME.

00:03:07.119 --> 00:03:09.913
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF IT?

00:03:09.915 --> 00:03:11.161
&gt;&gt; THE TRADITIONAL MEDIA IS

00:03:11.195 --> 00:03:12.741
RIGHT BEHIND THE MOB.

00:03:12.743 --> 00:03:14.773
WE ARE NOT ALLOWED TO USE THAT

00:03:14.774 --> 00:03:15.315
WORD ANYMORE.

00:03:15.316 --> 00:03:18.726
A LOUD CROWD OF ANGRY PEOPLE AND

00:03:18.728 --> 00:03:20.361
THEY ARE SUPPORTING THESE

00:03:20.395 --> 00:03:22.320
ENTITIES WHICH ARE FROM MY

00:03:22.322 --> 00:03:23.166
UNDERSTANDING MARXIST AND OPPOSE

00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:24.697
EVERY THING I STAND BORN I HOLD

00:03:24.698 --> 00:03:25.479
DEAR.

00:03:25.513 --> 00:03:27.566
WE HAVE GOTTEN TREMENDOUS

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.226
SUPPORT FROM ORDINARY PEOPLE.

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.445
MY PHONES IN MY EMAILS ARE AT

00:03:31.446 --> 00:03:32.313
ABOUT 90% POSITIVE.

00:03:32.348 --> 00:03:33.915
WE HAVE GOTTEN CALLS FROM ALL

00:03:33.916 --> 00:03:35.288
