00:03:35.289 --> 00:03:37.394
I GOT A NICE LETTER FROM A LADY

00:03:37.429 --> 00:03:39.079
IN IRELAND CONGRATULATED US FOR

00:03:39.114 --> 00:03:40.586
TAKING A STAND AGAINST VIOLENCE

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:41.742
AND SO I THINK THAT THE

00:03:41.776 --> 00:03:43.421
VAST MAJORITY OF AMERICANS WISH

00:03:43.455 --> 00:03:44.638
THEY COULD DO SOMETHING.

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.211
THE PROBLEM IS IF NOBODY STANDS

00:03:47.212 --> 00:03:49.001
UP AND SUPPORTS THEM, IF THE

00:03:49.002 --> 00:03:50.006
MEDIA BLASTS THEM, I’M

00:03:50.007 --> 00:03:50.313
SELF-EMPLOYED.

00:03:50.314 --> 00:03:52.439
I OWN MY OWN LAW FIRM.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:53.725
WHAT IF I WAS AN EMPLOYEE

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:53.950
