00:03:53.984 --> 00:03:55.780
IF I DID WHAT I DID AND I WAS AN

00:03:55.815 --> 00:03:56.984
EMPLOYEE OF ANYBODY ELSE, I

00:03:57.018 --> 00:03:58.669
WOULD HAVE BEEN CANNED THE NEXT

00:03:58.671 --> 00:03:59.023
DAY.

00:03:59.024 --> 00:04:00.368
MY FAMILY WOULD’VE BEEN CANNED.

00:04:00.369 --> 00:04:01.527
NO ONE WOULD EVER GET A JOB

00:04:01.528 --> 00:04:02.023
AGAIN.

00:04:02.024 --> 00:04:04.228
THIS IS THE KIND OF SOCIAL

00:04:04.229 --> 00:04:05.933
PRESSURE THAT KEEPS PEOPLE FROM

00:04:05.934 --> 00:04:06.952
STANDING UP AND DEFENDING

00:04:06.953 --> 00:04:08.596
THEMSELVES AND I THINK IT’S TIME

00:04:08.597 --> 00:04:09.632
FOR PEOPLE TO TAKE A DIFFERENT

00:04:09.633 --> 00:04:10.162
STAND.

00:04:10.197 --> 00:04:12.525
ACTUALLY STAND UP AND HAVE SOME

00:04:12.559 --> 00:04:12.947
RISK.

00:04:12.949 --> 00:04:14.777
PATRICK HENRY SAID GIVE ME

00:04:14.778 --> 00:04:16.434
LIBERTY OR GIVE ME DEATH AND NOW

00:04:16.435 --> 00:04:17.511
EVERYBODY SO AFRAID OF LOSING

00:04:17.512 --> 00:04:18.274
THEIR JOB.

00:04:18.275 --> 00:04:19.425
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I THINK YOU’RE

00:04:19.459 --> 00:04:19.993
EXACTLY RIGHT.

00:04:19.995 --> 00:04:21.760
SLOGANS LIKE THAT ARE

